{"4493130":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Ski-E-O! Ski Resort Tycoon","steam_appid":4493130,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Playtest the game! Give Feedback and meet fellow Skiers!<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/57bf528234264b64cfb2ba8645707358.avif?t=1792696424\" width=780 height=177 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>Development Roadmap<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/45024ee2e15f130bb6ba6a69c86a0c95.avif?t=1792696424\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras_big\/45024ee2e15f130bb6ba6a69c86a0c95.webp?t=1792696424 width=1560 height=1021 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>Key Art<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Art \/ Capsule Illustration by MLC Studio. <br><\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/909c8945c1ebe50fcb5c52c1ab3a08f6.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1527 height=362 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the Legendary Ski Resort you've always dreamed of.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with just a ticket office and a bit of cash. Transform an empty mountain into a Legendary Resort in this management tycoon game from an industry veteran and passionate skier.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/2935a4d110c25cb1d738d5a109779fcd.poster.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/2935a4d110c25cb1d738d5a109779fcd.webm?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/2935a4d110c25cb1d738d5a109779fcd.mp4?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/fd1b475e40d7d187d5f33a0b5aeb12b9.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1527 height=362 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rigid grid system. Paint trails directly onto terrain built from real LiDAR data from around the world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need a variety of trails for all types of skiers: green circles for beginners, black diamonds for the brave.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build cozy ski villages with lodges, restaurants, après bars, shopping, and more!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/3a208b598ac657e9fe6126c238397813.poster.avif?t=1792696424\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/3a208b598ac657e9fe6126c238397813.webm?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/3a208b598ac657e9fe6126c238397813.mp4?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/c9b4e7e618ec8ecb380e23a4d67aa8b9.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1527 height=362 \/><\/span>See to the needs of thousands of guests as they arrive at your resort - everyone wants something different, so make sure to keep them happy. Some are there to chill, others are there to shred. <br><i>Watch a Jerry wipe out on an expert trail he had no business entering! And make sure you have enough Ski Patrol hired to help him out after you’re done laughing.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/778d1d2420ffd8a2a1ff383152a45630.avif?t=1792696424\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras_big\/778d1d2420ffd8a2a1ff383152a45630.avif?t=1792696424 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone came to ski! Place buildings that satisfy a variety of guests, from waffle stands to spas, warming huts to five-star hotels.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/596ae5859cd4be3172204d50cf60b22a.poster.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/596ae5859cd4be3172204d50cf60b22a.webm?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/596ae5859cd4be3172204d50cf60b22a.mp4?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/20b57475dfda6fc863bea425cb75fba8.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1527 height=362 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every peak is built from real-world elevation data: the actual ridgelines, fall lines, and the weather that comes with them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/7ad0e71ebcabc755de5681800bb79b3c.poster.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/7ad0e71ebcabc755de5681800bb79b3c.webm?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/7ad0e71ebcabc755de5681800bb79b3c.mp4?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow falls, settles, melts, and drifts on a GPU-simulated snowpack, and skiers carve real grooves into the powder as they go.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An El Niño year turns the storms warm and wet. Snow turns to rain and wipes out your trails.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drought means running snowblowers around the clock just to stay open.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big dump buries your buildings before the lifts even spin.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cool summer keeps your peaks soft and fluffy for the next season.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The East is cold and icy, with little natural snow. Run your snowmakers to keep your guests from wiping out.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utah serves up light, consistent powder, the most forgiving place to build.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sierras flip between massive blizzards that bury your mountains and stubborn dry spells that melt what's there.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Colorado Rockies pair dependable snowfall with brutal, high-altitude cold that tests how warm you keep your guests.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the Pacific Northwest never stops dumping deep, heavy snow, keeping your groomers working overtime.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/04164be54e0d30d13cab66f433cee3c4.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1455 height=813 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play across every major ski region on Earth - from the five US regions to Japan, the Alps, the Andes, Canada, Australia and New Zealand, and China.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/c5cef194a442f2bceaa3e9beb51ad1f0.avif?t=1792696424\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras_big\/c5cef194a442f2bceaa3e9beb51ad1f0.avif?t=1792696424 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/909c8945c1ebe50fcb5c52c1ab3a08f6.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1527 height=362 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the Legendary Ski Resort you've always dreamed of.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with just a ticket office and a bit of cash. Transform an empty mountain into a Legendary Resort in this management tycoon game from an industry veteran and passionate skier.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/2935a4d110c25cb1d738d5a109779fcd.poster.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/2935a4d110c25cb1d738d5a109779fcd.webm?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/2935a4d110c25cb1d738d5a109779fcd.mp4?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/fd1b475e40d7d187d5f33a0b5aeb12b9.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1527 height=362 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rigid grid system. Paint trails directly onto terrain built from real LiDAR data from around the world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need a variety of trails for all types of skiers: green circles for beginners, black diamonds for the brave.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build cozy ski villages with lodges, restaurants, après bars, shopping, and more!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/3a208b598ac657e9fe6126c238397813.poster.avif?t=1792696424\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/3a208b598ac657e9fe6126c238397813.webm?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/3a208b598ac657e9fe6126c238397813.mp4?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/c9b4e7e618ec8ecb380e23a4d67aa8b9.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1527 height=362 \/><\/span>See to the needs of thousands of guests as they arrive at your resort - everyone wants something different, so make sure to keep them happy. Some are there to chill, others are there to shred. <br><i>Watch a Jerry wipe out on an expert trail he had no business entering! And make sure you have enough Ski Patrol hired to help him out after you’re done laughing.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/778d1d2420ffd8a2a1ff383152a45630.avif?t=1792696424\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras_big\/778d1d2420ffd8a2a1ff383152a45630.avif?t=1792696424 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone came to ski! Place buildings that satisfy a variety of guests, from waffle stands to spas, warming huts to five-star hotels.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/596ae5859cd4be3172204d50cf60b22a.poster.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/596ae5859cd4be3172204d50cf60b22a.webm?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/596ae5859cd4be3172204d50cf60b22a.mp4?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/20b57475dfda6fc863bea425cb75fba8.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1527 height=362 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every peak is built from real-world elevation data: the actual ridgelines, fall lines, and the weather that comes with them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/7ad0e71ebcabc755de5681800bb79b3c.poster.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/7ad0e71ebcabc755de5681800bb79b3c.webm?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/7ad0e71ebcabc755de5681800bb79b3c.mp4?t=1792696424\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow falls, settles, melts, and drifts on a GPU-simulated snowpack, and skiers carve real grooves into the powder as they go.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An El Niño year turns the storms warm and wet. Snow turns to rain and wipes out your trails.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drought means running snowblowers around the clock just to stay open.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big dump buries your buildings before the lifts even spin.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cool summer keeps your peaks soft and fluffy for the next season.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The East is cold and icy, with little natural snow. Run your snowmakers to keep your guests from wiping out.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utah serves up light, consistent powder, the most forgiving place to build.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sierras flip between massive blizzards that bury your mountains and stubborn dry spells that melt what's there.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Colorado Rockies pair dependable snowfall with brutal, high-altitude cold that tests how warm you keep your guests.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the Pacific Northwest never stops dumping deep, heavy snow, keeping your groomers working overtime.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/04164be54e0d30d13cab66f433cee3c4.avif?t=1792696424\" width=1455 height=813 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play across every major ski region on Earth - from the five US regions to Japan, the Alps, the Andes, Canada, Australia and New Zealand, and China.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras\/c5cef194a442f2bceaa3e9beb51ad1f0.avif?t=1792696424\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/extras_big\/c5cef194a442f2bceaa3e9beb51ad1f0.avif?t=1792696424 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"You're the Ski-E-O - build the cozy ski resort of your dreams in this management tycoon game. Adapt to ever-changing weather, paint trails, build lifts, and place the lodges and après bars that keep thousands of skiers warm, fed, and happy.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/0188d1a232e5ab2c906e136031e52da8486cbe77\/header.jpg?t=1792696424","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/95b86f4b95e46642220c10fcf3dc12dc32b63775\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792696424","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4493130\/95b86f4b95e46642220c10fcf3dc12dc32b63775\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792696424","website":"https:\/\/skieogame.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit (version 2004 or later)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600 (6-core)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 \/ GTX 1660 \/ AMD RX 6600 \/ Intel Arc A750<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 10 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> SSD strongly recommended. Requires a GPU supporting DirectX 12 Shader Model 6.6 with 64-bit atomics. Not supported: Windows on ARM (Qualcomm Snapdragon laptops).<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-12400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 5600X (6-core)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 32 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 (DLSS) \/ AMD RX 6600 \/ 6650 XT (FSR)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 10 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> SSD strongly recommended. Requires a GPU supporting DirectX 12 Shader Model 6.6 with 64-bit atomics. Not supported: Windows on ARM (Qualcomm Snapdragon laptops).<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 15 Sequoia<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M2 or later (Apple Silicon required - Intel Macs not supported)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 10 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS15+<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M2 Pro\/M3 (Apple Silicon required - Intel Macs not supported)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 24 GB RAM<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"}}}}